  "articles": [
    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "1. How to ask the total price you pay\n\nIn English, when you have bought several items or you want to make sure of the price you must pay, you might ask 'How much is that in all?' The Japanese expression for this is:\n\nZenbu de ikura desu ka?    How much is it altogether?"
    }
